  "description": "The Tutto Mini is the quirkiest bike Cinelli has designed. Twenty-inch wheels, a Columbus Cromor steel frame, and enough mounts and dropout options to run it fixed, singlespeed or geared.\nFor Cinelli Icons, Mike Giant has turned it into a canvas. His artwork pulls pieces from the Cinelli archive (the Laser frame, 1A stem, Unicanitor saddle, Bat and RAM bars, Integralter, lugs, bottle and bar tape) and arranges them like a tattoo flash sheet. At the centre, his coiled snake wraps around the winged C. Black and white, clean vector lines, unmistakably his.\nThe build sits on the same line between street and workshop. Paul Components Klamper callipers and Love Levers, White Industries cranks, headset and seat collar, Maxxis Holy Roller tyres, a Stay Strong cruiser bar and Cinelli's own Volare saddle. Limited edition.",
